### List all students (happy path)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/students

###

### Create student (happy path)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Create second student for the same parent (happy path)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "firstName": "Мария",
  "lastName": "Петрова",
  "email": "maria.petrova@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Create student — parent not found (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": "ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Create student — duplicate email (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "firstName": "Иван",
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "email": "ivan.petrov@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Create student — invalid input (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Петров",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}
